program written by bludfud_

Just a simple program written up in a whim that shows you the lyrics to Beetles by Aphex Twin (Richard D. James).
Please verify the checksum before running the script.

Before running, you will need to do the following;
1. Install mpv
2. Obtain the song, rename it to mus.mp3, and move it to the folder
3. Make sure your speakers/headphones are plugged up
4. Run chmod +x beetles.sh
And you'll be done! To start the program, run the command ./beetles.sh.
If you get some errors, please make a issue post on Github.
